@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/classes
@classId = 1
@studentId = 1

### Listar turmas ativas
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar turmas arquivadas
GET {{baseUrl}}?status=archived
Accept: application/json

### Criar turma (use o data.id retornado como classId nas proximas chamadas)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Engenharia de Software - 4a fase",
  "subject": "Banco de Dados",
  "academicTerm": "2026/2"
}

### Consultar detalhes e alunos
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{classId}}
Accept: application/json

### Editar ou reativar turma
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{classId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Engenharia de Software - 4a fase",
  "subject": "Banco de Dados",
  "academicTerm": "2026/2",
  "status": "active"
}

### Regenerar convite
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{classId}}/invite-code

### Listar alunos
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{classId}}/students
Accept: application/json

### Vincular aluno existente por e-mail
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{classId}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao.silva@catolicasc.edu.br"
}

### Vincular aluno existente por ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{classId}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{studentId}}
}

### Vincular aluno existente por matricula
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{classId}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "registration": "20260001"
}

### Cadastrar e vincular novo aluno (use o data.id retornado como studentId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{classId}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Aluno Exemplo",
  "registration": "20260009",
  "email": "aluno.exemplo@catolicasc.edu.br"
}

### Consultar notas do aluno na turma
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{classId}}/students/{{studentId}}/grades
Accept: application/json

### Remover somente o vinculo do aluno
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{classId}}/students/{{studentId}}

### Arquivar turma, preservando seus dados e historico
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{classId}}
